{"words": [{"text": "تِلْكَ", "translation": "These"}, {"text": "حُدُودُ", "translation": "(are the) limits"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۚ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَمَن", "translation": "and whoever"}, {"text": "يُطِعِ", "translation": "obeys"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَرَسُولَهُۥ", "translation": "and His Messenger"}, {"text": "يُدْخِلْهُ", "translation": "He will admit him"}, {"text": "جَنَّـٰتٍۢ", "translation": "(to) Gardens"}, {"text": "تَجْرِى", "translation": "flows"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "تَحْتِهَا", "translation": "underneath them"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ", "translation": "the rivers "}, {"text": "خَـٰلِدِينَ", "translation": "(will) abide forever"}, {"text": "فِيهَا ۚ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "وَذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "And that"}, {"text": "ٱلْفَوْزُ", "translation": "(is) the success"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَظِيمُ", "translation": "[the] great"}], "sahih": "These are the limits [set by] Allāh, and whoever obeys Allāh and His Messenger will be admitted by Him to gardens [in Paradise] under which rivers flow, abiding eternally therein; and that is the great attainment."}